<title>USA: Bell Helicopter Textron wins Navy contract.</title>
<headline>Bell Helicopter Textron wins Navy contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Navy said Thursday it has awarded a $134 million contract increase to Bell Helicopter Textron Inc, to upgrade UH-1N Huey helicopters.</p>
<p>It said the work is expected to be completed at Fort Worth by September 2003.</p>
</text>
